{"title":"1999 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(answer_choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (answer choices)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/8/c287e0dd73392384b31bfe312cdaaff37975b35f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1999 - 999 + 99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"128\" height=\"15\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/f/2dfc6c89d16a81010eb5a860ef9e297d50b36b59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 901  \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 1099 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 1000 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 199 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"433\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/7/d47a227274bc9a8025cfb9e37701c1749ec0b45f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1999 - 999 + 99 = 1000 + 99 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }1099}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"336\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/0/04003e1a630efc44ec0e7f6e532cf92ad21b6024.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1999$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> is approximately <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/f/05f1ffc8a6829f25b0b0366087a70dfd4e06fef6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/0/0705411d92671faf1fe5602cfef8f353c7f0f83d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$999$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> is approximately <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a313bf06349648df7be807bee95b651604ce7a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is approximately <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />. This means we can approximate the solution as:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/6/416956c53d2dffaba84da90b323135b3d5b3010b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2000 - 1000 + 100 = 1100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"207\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>The closest answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/e/72e55f78dbd134e60ecc7a07fccf3513e404025e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }1099}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"84\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28answer_choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(answer_choices)\">Solution 3 (answer choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (answer choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a313bf06349648df7be807bee95b651604ce7a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> from the answer choices and then adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/0/0705411d92671faf1fe5602cfef8f353c7f0f83d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$999$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, or simply adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/d/fdd4beaeec1aa15c400a0763d78937b0385924b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$900$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> to the answer choices, should give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/0/04003e1a630efc44ec0e7f6e532cf92ad21b6024.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1999$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>Adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/d/fdd4beaeec1aa15c400a0763d78937b0385924b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$900$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> to each answer gives:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/5/ab5aa401b158021fdc2cb1f51c2c0a231c7591e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 1801  \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 1999 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 1900 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 1099 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 999$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"460\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/e/72e55f78dbd134e60ecc7a07fccf3513e404025e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }1099}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"84\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"1999 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">1999 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems\" title=\"1999 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1999 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan